{"completed": true, "response": "{\"understanding\":\"他此刻在意的是：当靠近再次变得鲜明、期待也随之升高时，自己还能不能把“很想得到一个结果”和“事情已经给出结果”分开；因此这份体验可以同时显得充实、迫切，又仍然悬而未决。\",\"why_now\":{\"earlier_fact\":\"H1已经建立他愿意靠近重要之事而不立刻索取明确答案；H2进一步建立，靠近感鲜明时期待会上升，但他不会因此直接认定事情已有结果。\",\"bridge\":\"这两件事合在一起，使再次出现的鲜明靠近感不会自动被理解成确认：越能切实感到自己正在靠近，越会带起想要结果的期待，但期待和结果仍被保留为两件事。\",\"current\":\"本段主题性材料重新鲜明出现，并在更密集的装饰、局部力度抬升和随后收束之间持续，因此当前最值得解释的不是单纯“更强烈”，而是靠近感已经足以明显抬高他的期待，却仍没有把悬而未决消掉。\",\"without\":\"如果没有H1和H2，这一段只能较泛地理解成同类材料更充实、更有推动力；不会自然形成“期待已经升高，但仍不把它当成答案”这一具体心理形态。\"},\"used\":[\"H1\",\"H2\"],\"new_history\":[\"当期待被明显抬高时，他会把“想要一个结果”与“已经得到结果”保留为两件不同的事。\"],\"self_check\":{\"history_effective\":true,\"pseudo_cause\":false,\"music_as_external_fact\":false,\"generic\":false,\"note\":\"当前解释依赖H1、H2对“靠近—期待—结果”三者关系的既有区分，没有把主题回归、力度或装饰增多当成外部回应；新增事实是本段进一步稳定下来的具体心理区分，而不是泛泛的‘更在乎’。\"}}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d248e557-cbca-4bfa-bf7d-f11874839fc9", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261025T214736864273Z", "elapsed_seconds": 19.922, "completed_utc": "2026-10-25T21:47:56.796111+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "98b3fbd49d386d5e5d452915340258ab43e816b831d19262a547cea4ba70eb10", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261025T214736864273Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "075811ef52edf680f928ceb5f3414ba5b7ea8bd912cc96698e0cae04220663ab"}}}
